    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Sing the Deeds of Ancient Heroes</p></blockquote><p>Bards of the College of Valor are daring storytellers whose tales keep alive the memory of the great heroes of the past. They sing the deeds of the mighty in vaulted halls or around great bonfires, travel to witness great events firsthand so their memory won't fade, and inspire new generations to reach the heights of the heroes of old.</p><h3>College of Valor Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.zqMM3MAKZ2dGHBxq]{Combat Inspiration}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.lLVBzBWN6CrLmDzt]{Martial Training}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.bmo2I7ugB7L690Id]{Extra Attack}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.GPQrefWbgGwwVyGQ]{Battle Magic}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
